.TH IKEBACK-CONFIGURATOR 1 2018-12-07 Ikeback
.SH NAME
ikeback-configurator \- Ikeback Configurator
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBikeback-configurator\fP
.SH DESCRIPTION

\fBIKEBACK-CONFIGURATOR\fR is a configuration tool which allows the site
admin to configure and customize all components of a local Ikeback
installation through a graphical user interface. The program is started
by the administrator with elevated privileges whenever necessary.

.PP
For more information about the ikeback-configurator, point your browser to file:///usr/share/doc/packages/ikeback-configurator or https://github.com/zk26/ikeback/.
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR ikeback-service (1), ikeback-master (1)

.PP
.IR https://github.com/zk26/ikeback/

